    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Citibank has traditionally reinforced its commitment to social welfare by promoting educational programs over the last decade. In keeping with this commitment, Citibank has contributed Rs.1 million to the Aga Khan University's (AKU) Medical College. This funding will complement AKU's effort towards covering tuition fees for medical students who are unable to finance their education. Citibank has in recent years assisted various prestigious educational institutions by providing financial assistance as well as teachers who are experienced bankers.",
